{"ref":"BDB, קֵ֫דֶם","hw":"קֵ֫דֶם","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קֵ֫דֶם</span>]</big>  c. ה loc. i. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִ֫דְמָה</span> <strong>adv. eastward to, toward the East</strong>;—<a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:6\" href=\"/Genesis.25.6\">Gn 25:6</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.16\">Lv 1:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.14\">16:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:3\" href=\"/Numbers.34.3\">Nu 34:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:11\" href=\"/Numbers.34.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:15\" href=\"/Numbers.34.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:12\" href=\"/Joshua.19.12\">Jos 19:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:13\" href=\"/Joshua.19.13\">13</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:39\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.39\">1 K 7:39</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.10\">2 Ch 4:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.3\">1 K 17:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.17\">2 K 13:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.16\">Ez 8:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; + N, S, W, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:14\" href=\"/Genesis.13.14\">Gn 13:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:14\" href=\"/Genesis.28.14\">28:14</a> (both J), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:3\" href=\"/Numbers.2.3\">Nu 2:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:28\" href=\"/Numbers.3.28\">3:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:5\" href=\"/Numbers.10.5\">10:5</a> (N, W, in 𝔊), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:10\" href=\"/Numbers.34.10\">34:10</a> (all P); also as <strong>n.</strong> after <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּאַח</span> = <em>E. side</em>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:13\" href=\"/Exodus.27.13\">Ex 27:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:13\" href=\"/Exodus.38.13\">38:13</a> (both P), + W <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.7\">Ez 45:7</a> (del. Co; read <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶדֶם</span> Berthol Toy Krae), + N, S, W, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:5\" href=\"/Numbers.35.5\">Nu 35:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:20\" href=\"/Joshua.18.20\">Jos 18:20</a> so <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבוּל ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:5\" href=\"/Joshua.15.5\">15:5</a> (all P).","next":"BDB, קַדְמָה","prev":"BDB, קָדַם"}